  "behavior": [
    "Exactly one role=thumbnail output is selected independently of normal logs; the existing JPEG/source/project/recipe/provenance validator is unchanged.",
    "Only canonical durable object/log outputs named job.stdout and job.stderr may accompany the thumbnail, once each, with their normal port, filename, variant and media type; creative metadata and other extras are refused.",
    "Missing or second thumbnail and each tested noncanonical companion return HTTP422 without task completion, generation/variant mutation, output associations, object rows or CAS publication.",
    "The two TypeScript conformance projections were regenerated from the existing generator. No test or generator template was edited.",
    "Agent evidence references the immutable package-owned Vibe pin authority instead of introducing another tracked selector; historical raw identities remain in the archive."
  ],
  "blockers": [
