  "observation_notes": [
    "All historical checkpoint/resume archives remain unchanged. Agent resume.json changed only its two Vibe pin values to immutable authority references.",
    "The new boundary test initially used an unavailable public name field. The corrected new assertion uses the public variant_key and adds exact persisted name/variant equality; every prior assertion remains. Its final identical-source before/head comparison is decisive. Earlier raw failures remain.",
    "The initial Agent pin run lacked Runtime import paths; another preliminary full-file run lacked ASTRID_VIBECOMFY_CHECKOUT. Corrected coherent before/after runs use the same required environment. Earlier observations remain.",
    "The intermediate runtime-ci-projection-after files precede the successful artifact correction and are failed uncorrected observations, not after-fix proof.",
    "CI snapshot contains 12 workflows on the previously published heads and selected raw lines for 19 failed jobs. It is historical; no complete green CI claim is made for the new heads.",
    "LS-8 and latency meter dependency-identity refusals remain NO-RESULT observations. Guards were not bypassed. Other unpaired CI failures are not asserted to be inherited.",
    "Prior full-path hash counts and D14 evidence remain in observations-resume.zip; they were not rerun after this narrow log-classifier correction."
  ],
